---
title: Ink, XP, and respec
pageSlug: ink-and-xp
mod: spell-codex
section: gameplay
order: 3
---

Unlocking a tier costs **XP** and **one matching rarity ink**.

Hold a matching school focus for a **25%** XP discount (ink cost stays the same).

**Respec** refunds a configurable share of spent XP. Only unlocked tiers of a spell can be cast — discovering a spell is not the same as paying for the next rank.

Ink slots sit under the Codex panel. If **+** does nothing, you are missing the rarity that matches the next tier, or you cannot afford the XP.
